  "body_html": "<h1>stdSimplex.mix_apply</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\n@[simp] theorem stdSimplex.mix_apply (α : 𝕜) (hα₀ : 0 ≤ α) (hα₁ : α ≤ 1) (x y : stdSimplex 𝕜 I) (i : I) : (stdSimplex.mix α hα₀ hα₁ x y).val i = α * x.val i + (1 - α) * y.val i</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>stdSimplex.mix</li>\n<li>Lottery.mix</li>\n</ul>",
